            <p>Kaarigar reserves the right, but not the obligation, to review, remove, restrict, or disable content that violates our policies or applicable law.</p>
            <h3 id="sec-14">14. Updates to This Policy</h3>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect:</p>
