            <h3 id="sec-16">16. Children's Privacy</h3>
            <p>Kaarigar is intended for individuals who are legally eligible to enter into binding contracts and engage in employment or business activities under applicable laws.</p>
            <p>Our Platform is not intended for individuals below 18 years of age, unless permitted under applicable law and with the consent of a parent or legal guardian where required.</p>
            <p>We do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If we become aware that personal data has been collected from a child in violation of applicable law, we may take reasonable steps to delete such information promptly.</p>
            <p>Parents or legal guardians who believe that a child has provided personal data to Kaarigar may contact our Grievance Officer for appropriate action.</p>
