            <p>Kaarigar may use automated systems, machine learning, or artificial intelligence to improve Platform functionality, including:</p>
            <ul><li>Matching employers with workers</li><li>Recommending jobs</li><li>Personalizing search results</li><li>Detecting fraudulent activities</li><li>Identifying duplicate accounts</li><li>Improving user experience</li><li>Analysing platform performance</li><li>These systems are intended to support operational efficiency and do not replace human judgment in all cases.</li><li>Where required by applicable law, users may request additional information regarding significant automated decisions affecting them.</li></ul>
            <h3 id="sec-21">21. Fraud Prevention and Platform Safety</h3>
            <p>To maintain a trusted marketplace, Kaarigar may process personal data for fraud prevention, risk management, and platform security.</p>
            <p>This may include:</p>
            <ul><li>Identity verification</li><li>Device verification</li><li>IP monitoring</li><li>Duplicate account detection</li><li>Payment risk assessment</li><li>Suspicious activity monitoring</li><li>Investigation of policy violations</li><li>Prevention of unauthorized access</li><li>Where necessary, accounts involved in suspected fraudulent activity may be restricted, suspended, or permanently removed.</li></ul>
