            <p>Users are responsible for ensuring that the personal information they provide to Kaarigar is accurate, complete, and up to date.</p>
            <p>Providing false, misleading, or inaccurate information may result in account suspension, restricted access, or other actions permitted under our Terms of Use.</p>
            <p>Kaarigar is not responsible for decisions made based on inaccurate information provided by users.</p>
            <h3 id="sec-23">23. Consent</h3>
            <p>Where processing is based on consent, users may withdraw their consent at any time by updating their account settings or contacting Kaarigar.</p>
            <p>Withdrawal of consent shall not affect the lawfulness of processing carried out before such withdrawal.</p>
            <p>Please note that withdrawing consent may limit or prevent access to certain Platform features or services.</p>
